## Monad Testnet chain id (10143) and RPC URL, used by viem on the frontend
VITE_MONAD_TESTNET_CHAIN_ID=10143
VITE_MONAD_TESTNET_RPC_URL=https://testnet-rpc.monad.xyz
VITE_MONAD_TESTNET_EXPLORER_URL=https://testnet.monadscan.com

## Wallet connection (Reown AppKit). Get a free project ID at https://dashboard.reown.com
VITE_REOWN_PROJECT_ID=

